 whom to call if a problem develops."}],["$","p","When you call Dr. Elsaadi’s office, have the hospital name, discharge date and recommended follow-up timing ready. If you cannot find the timing or instructions conflict, say so. This guide cannot determine the right interval for your hospitalization.",{"children":"When you call Dr. Elsaadi’s office, have the hospital name, discharge date and recommended follow-up timing ready. If you cannot find the timing or instructions conflict, say so. This guide cannot determine the right interval for your hospitalization."}]],false]}],["$","section","Make four labeled sections",{"id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Make four labeled sections"}],[["$","p","A folder with clear labels can help both you and anyone assisting you.",{"children":"A folder with clear labels can help both you and anyone assisting you."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"article-checklist","children":[["$","li","Medicines: the discharge list, current bottles and any differences you need clarified.",{"children":"Medicines: the discharge list, current bottles and any differences you need clarified."}],["$","li","Appointments: recommended visits, dates already arranged and visits still to schedule.",{"children":"Appointments: recommended visits, dates already arranged and visits still to schedule."}],["$","li","Results: completed reports you have and tests you were told were still pending.",{"children":"Results: completed reports you have and tests you were told were still pending."}],["$","li","Home needs: instructions about equipment, services or help with daily care.",{"children":"Home needs: instructions about equipment, services or help with daily care."}]]}]]}],["$","section","Assign an owner to unfinished tasks",{"id":"section-2","children":["$L25",["$L26","$L27"],false]}],"$L28"],"$L29","$L2a","$L2b"]}]]}]
