26:["$","p","For each pending result or appointment, ask who is responsible and how you should expect to hear back. “Someone will call” is hard to follow up on if you do not know which office.",{"children":"For each pending result or appointment, ask who is responsible and how you should expect to hear back. “Someone will call” is hard to follow up on if you do not know which office."}]
27:["$","p","Keep hospital and specialist instructions with their dates. If a previous medication list differs from the discharge list, do not create your own combination; contact the responsible clinician or pharmacist for clarification. Tell the office about any difficulty obtaining the prescribed medicines.",{"children":"Keep hospital and specialist instructions with their dates. If a previous medication list differs from the discharge list, do not create your own combination; contact the responsible clinician or pharmacist for clarification. Tell the office about any difficulty obtaining the prescribed medicines."}]
28:["$","section","Keep continuity realistic",{"id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Keep continuity realistic"}],[["$","p","Dr. Elsaadi is affiliated with St. Bernardine Medical Center and Community Hospital of San Bernardino and may personally follow patients in those facilities when needed. That does not mean every hospitalization is managed by him or that all records automatically reach the office.",{"children":"Dr. Elsaadi is affiliated with St. Bernardine Medical Center and Community Hospital of San Bernardino and may personally follow patients in those facilities when needed. That does not mean every hospitalization is managed by him or that all records automatically reach the office."}],["$","p","Bring your paperwork and ask what additional records should be requested. For an urgent concern, follow your discharge instructions and call for medical help; for an emergency, call 911. Do not rely on a portal appointment request for immediate attention.",{"children":"Bring your paperwork and ask what additional records should be requested. For an urgent concern, follow your discharge instructions and call for medical help; for an emergency, call 911. Do not rely on a portal appointment request for immediate attention."}]],false]}]
